@baseUrl = https://localhost:5501
@accessToken = replace-with-local-access-token

### Search external editions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/external-editions/search?title=Matilda&author=Roald%20Dahl
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### List provider statuses
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/external-editions/providers
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Queue an edition for import
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/external-editions/import
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "providerId": "openLibrary",
  "externalId": "OL7353617M",
  "shelfId": null
}

### Missing title returns 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/external-editions/search
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Anonymous provider status returns 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/external-editions/providers
